{"parentUuid":"20d6555e-305b-4739-8b10-0741f07678b9","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5329aa8252bef056","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cfp2eq2hj8PB5ytNxdWdT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017wkPKmxXAuTqFuizFY6BSS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n '1,50p' cuore/live/did_catalog.py && echo ---DEFS--- && grep -n \"^def \\|^class \\|^ACTUATION_BLOCKED\\|^[A-Z_]* = \" cuore/live/did_catalog.py cuore/live/safety.py cuore/live/actuate.py | head -80"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3033,"cache_read_input_tokens":99316,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3033,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_017wkPKmxXAuTqFuizFY6BSS":{"command":"cd /c/Users/User/mcp-servers && sed -n '1,50p' cuore/live/did_catalog.py && echo ---DEFS--- && grep -n \"^def \\|^class \\|^ACTUATION_BLOCKED\\|^[A-Z_]* = \" cuore/live/did_catalog.py cuore/live/safety.py cuore/live/actuate.py | head -80"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_017wkPKmxXAuTqFuizFY6BSS":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"5586334a-81da-47a1-8ecc-16b797c26823","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cfp2epk5wzWBn4LnGrPGc","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"324a8eea-e66b-457c-b76f-266663d7d467","timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:05:06.587Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"20d6555e-305b-4739-8b10-0741f07678b9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fcaf14d-b461-485c-917e-15f2f4ea677e","agentId":"a5329aa8252bef056","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LtxGP8RnuZAemyrGBjkrjf","type":"tool_result","content":"8:\"unknown\" is a valid entry. This file is data for `cuore/live/buses.py` and\n13:Every Stelvio scan in the archive taken with no cable (`SCAN_2606070954`,\n15:`2609041953`) finds the same eight modules, and `SCAN_2609042008` alone finds a\n16:disjoint six. That is a hardware bus partition observed seven times:\n18:- **No cable (CAN-C, pins 6/14):** ECM, IPC, TCM, DTCM, ESM, BCM, RFHUB, DASM\n19:- **One cable (CAN-CH, pins 12/13, grey A6):** ABS, EPS, ORC, AFLS, PAM, HALF\n23:group 2 = grey A6 = CAN-CH is `CONFIRMED`.\n26:BCM and IPC on CAN-IHS: on this car they answer on CAN-C with no cable. The\n27:Marelli 949 BCM is the gateway and is diagnostically reachable on the C bus.\n29:**The blue A5 / CAN-IHS bus has never been scanned on this car.** HVAC,\n35:Sources: `SCAN_2609041953.txt`, `SCAN_2609042008.txt`,\n40:| ECM | Magneti Marelli IAW 10JA CF6/EOBD Injection (2.0) | `00 01 50 40 18` | MM10JAHW232 (00) | P235QB39 (0000) | CAN-C `CONFIRMED` | none | `0x10` → `18DA10F1` / `18DAF110` | danardi78 header `DA10F1`; ClaudeMarais ESP32 repo | CONFIRMED | `STP 34` (`STP 33` for legislated `7E0/7E8`) |\n41:| TCM | ZF 8HP50/75 Automatic Gearbox | `00 0B 50 AA 14` | 10344202761 (20) | GK0902OE2HN (0003) | CAN-C `CONFIRMED` | none | `0x18` → `18DA18F1` / `18DAF118` | danardi78 header `DA18F1` | CONFIRMED | `STP 34` |\n42:| BCM | Body Computer Marelli (949), gateway | `00 00 70 7C 15` | BCM949M_C02 (01) | 04441660441 (1454) | CAN-C (diag) `CONFIRMED`; gateways IHS | none | `0x40` → `18DA40F1` / `18DAF140` | danardi78 header `DA40F1` (IBS, key position, light switch) | CONFIRMED | `STP 34` |\n43:| IPC | Instrument Panel Continental | `00 03 50 8B 14` | A2C11140400 (01) | AR952 HL (203C) | CAN-C `CONFIRMED` | none | `0x60` → `18DA60F1` / `18DAF160` | danardi78 header `DA60F1` | CONFIRMED | `STP 34` |\n44:| RFHUB | Radio frequency hub Continental | `00 41 50 89 15` | 10161500AA (01) | 10307064AB (0940) | CAN-C `CONFIRMED` | none | `0xC7` → `18DAC7F1` / `18DAF1C7` | danardi78 header `DAC7F1` (TPMS `2240B1..B4`) | CONFIRMED address; INFERRED that it is RFHUB | `STP 34` |\n45:| DTCM | Magna Q4 Transfer Case | `00 43 50 91 14` | M0045027.01 (21) | M0099947 (0501) | CAN-C `CONFIRMED` | none | unknown (`0x29` in stelvio_scan, self-declared unsourced) | — | UNVERIFIED | `STP 34` |\n46:| ESM | ZF Electronic Gear Shift Module | `00 16 50 B4 14` | 1000597140 (08) | 1000678050 (0019) | CAN-C `CONFIRMED` | none | unknown | — | — | `STP 34` |\n47:| DASM | Driver assistance radar Bosch | `00 39 70 7E 15` | MRR1evo14F (00) | 52081920 (0500) | CAN-C `CONFIRMED` (7/7 scans without cable) | none | unknown | — | — | `STP 34` |\n48:| ABS | Continental ABS MK C1 | `00 06 50 5B 14` | 28554010535 (00) | XJ_RAL00165 (83C1) | CAN-CH `CONFIRMED` | grey A6 | `0x28` | stelvio_scan only | UNVERIFIED | `STP 34` (500 k assumed) |\n49:| EPS | ZF Electric Steering | `00 02 40 5F 14` | 7806277500 (30) | 880802D0243 (A410) | CAN-CH `CONFIRMED` | grey A6 | `0x2A` → `18DA2AF1` | danardi78 header `DA2AF1` returns steering angle; conflicts with stelvio_scan SAS `0x76` | INFERRED (medium) | `STP 34` |\n50:| ORC | Airbag / Occupant Restraint (MES: unsupported) | `00 1A 70 84 15` | 0285013327 (30) | BB70578 (0403) | CAN-CH `CONFIRMED` | grey A6 | `0x50` | stelvio_scan only | UNVERIFIED | `STP 34` |\n51:| AFLS | Automotive Lighting adaptive headlights | `00 1D 50 C7 14` | 1470000328 (02) | 1409910330 (000C) | CAN-CH `CONFIRMED` | grey A6 | unknown | — | — | `STP 34` |\n52:| PAM | Parking control Bosch | `00 18 50 87 15` | 19490108 (03) | 1.38 (0304) | CAN-CH `CONFIRMED` | grey A6 | unknown | — | — | `STP 34` |\n53:| HALF | Haptical lane feedback camera Bosch (MFK2) | `00 1E 50 72 14` | 0203500279 (01) | 1037601726 (1001) | CAN-CH `CONFIRMED` (MES lists `ELMA6`) | grey A6 | unknown | — | — | `STP 34` |\n55:Pseudo-entries on the no-cable bus: `PROXI` (CAN Setup / PROXI Alignment (949),\n66:All `UNVERIFIED` presence; bus and cable from the MES vendor capability matrix\n71:| HVAC | Climate control (TRW) | CAN-IHS | blue A5 | never scanned |\n72:| ETM / EMCM / DSM | AlfaConnect radio-nav / uConnect | CAN-IHS | blue A5 | never scanned |\n73:| AMP | Amplifier | CAN-IHS | blue A5 | never scanned |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7bc1c2e3-aa98-4c8d-b991-f924ac99137c","timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:05:07.336Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"8:\"unknown\" is a valid entry. This file is data for `cuore/live/buses.py` and\n13:Every Stelvio scan in the archive taken with no cable (`SCAN_2606070954`,\n15:`2609041953`) finds the same eight modules, and `SCAN_2609042008` alone finds a\n16:disjoint six. That is a hardware bus partition observed seven times:\n18:- **No cable (CAN-C, pins 6/14):** ECM, IPC, TCM, DTCM, ESM, BCM, RFHUB, DASM\n19:- **One cable (CAN-CH, pins 12/13, grey A6):** ABS, EPS, ORC, AFLS, PAM, HALF\n23:group 2 = grey A6 = CAN-CH is `CONFIRMED`.\n26:BCM and IPC on CAN-IHS: on this car they answer on CAN-C with no cable. The\n27:Marelli 949 BCM is the gateway and is diagnostically reachable on the C bus.\n29:**The blue A5 / CAN-IHS bus has never been scanned on this car.** HVAC,\n35:Sources: `SCAN_2609041953.txt`, `SCAN_2609042008.txt`,\n40:| ECM | Magneti Marelli IAW 10JA CF6/EOBD Injection (2.0) | `00 01 50 40 18` | MM10JAHW232 (00) | P235QB39 (0000) | CAN-C `CONFIRMED` | none | `0x10` → `18DA10F1` / `18DAF110` | danardi78 header `DA10F1`; ClaudeMarais ESP32 repo | CONFIRMED | `STP 34` (`STP 33` for legislated `7E0/7E8`) |\n41:| TCM | ZF 8HP50/75 Automatic Gearbox | `00 0B 50 AA 14` | 10344202761 (20) | GK0902OE2HN (0003) | CAN-C `CONFIRMED` | none | `0x18` → `18DA18F1` / `18DAF118` | danardi78 header `DA18F1` | CONFIRMED | `STP 34` |\n42:| BCM | Body Computer Marelli (949